# SplitWala — no API keys or credentials needed!
#
# whatsapp-web.js works by running a real WhatsApp Web session.
# You log in once by scanning a QR code in the terminal.
# Your session is then saved automatically in .wwebjs_auth/
# so you don't need to scan again on the next run.
#
# There is nothing to configure here for the basic bot.
# If you add features later (e.g. a database URL), put them here:
#
# DATABASE_URL=...
